          <div class='panel-head'><div class='sword-line'></div><div><h3>📋 网评摘录</h3><p>来自读者社区 · 仅供参考</p></div></div>
          <div class='reviews-list' id='reviews-list'><div class='review-item' onclick='showBookModal("玄鉴仙族")' style='cursor:pointer'><div class='review-book'>⭐ 玄鉴仙族</div><div class='review-snippet'>家族修仙巅峰之作，被誉为「修仙版《百年孤独》」。凡人流家族群像，以写家史的方法写修仙，陆江仙残魂附镜引李家世代崛起。世代交替、前赴后继的史诗感，发刀不手软。；凡人流家族群像，写出了世代交替、前赴后继的史诗感。李通崖身负重伤洞中坐化，李玄锋独…</div><div class='review-src'>起点图</div></div>
<div class='review-item' onclick='showBookModal("夜无疆")' style='cursor:pointer'><div class='review-book'>⭐ 夜无疆</div><div class='review-snippet'>红毛大帝重出江湖！永夜世界观颠覆设定，开篇「那一天太阳落下就再也没有升起」一句话钩住所有读者。东哥文笔网文顶尖，画面感极强，主角杀伐果断，女性角色刻画明显进步。1693赞 · 全场最高记录。；恢宏大气，热血逆袭，世界观层层剥开引人入胜。</div><div class='review-src'>起点图</div></div>
<div class='review-item' onclick='showBookModal("捞尸人")' style='cursor:pointer'><div class='review-book'>⭐ 捞尸人</div><div class='review-snippet'>「人知鬼恐怖，鬼晓人心毒」。民俗悬疑题材，氛围拉满，读者形容「专治一目十行，每章看完要五分钟」。出圈指数98，推荐值95，一口气一百多章停不下来，毛骨悚然但欲罢不能。；悬疑氛围刻画得太到位了，一口气看了一百多章，根本停不下来。</div><div class='review-src'>起点图</div></div>
<div class='review-item' onclick='showBookModal("诡秘之主")' style='cursor:pointer'><div class='review-book'>⭐ 诡秘之主</div><div class='review-snippet'>网文天花板，现象级作品，错过就跟不上时代。克苏鲁+蒸汽朋克+维多利亚风，22条非凡途径设定严谨。「我们是守护者，也是一群时刻对抗着危险和疯狂的可怜虫。」——经典语录。；硬生生把小众克苏鲁带火。乌贼每写一本书都像在给网文拓宽一次边界。</div><div class='review-src'>起点图</div></div>
<div class='review-item' onclick='showBookModal("深海余烬")' style='cursor:pointer'><div class='review-book'>⭐ 深海余烬</div><div class='review-snippet'>「谁知道船咋开啊？」——克系蒸汽朋克大航海背景，十万均订完本。悬疑氛围几乎拉满，城邦副本构思缜密。大眼珠子远瞳一贯的「人民史观+成人童话」，幽默与史诗感并存。；剧情有点意思，诡异氛围很足，节奏很快，一口气能看很多章。</div><div class='review-src'>起点图</div></div>
<div class='review-item' onclick='showBookModal("道诡异仙")' style='cursor:pointer'><div class='review-book'>⭐ 道诡异仙</div><div class='review-snippet'>东方克苏鲁+民俗怪谈，十万均订年度最出圈网文之一。「妈，我真的分不清啊！」——主角李火旺在现实与诡异修仙世界反复穿梭，精神濒临崩溃。「道爷我成啦！！」成为破圈名梗。；我看过最癫的小说，设定新奇非常推荐。</div><div class='review-src'>起点图</div></div>
<div class='review-item' onclick='showBookModal("没钱修什么仙？")' style='cursor:pointer'><div class='review-book'>⭐ 没钱修什么仙？</div><div class='review-snippet'>「没钱修什么仙？」——赛博朋克修仙世界，全民氪金撸贷修炼，资本主义修仙社会的极致推演。熊狼狗脑洞炸裂，剧情在癫与燃之间反复横跳，1704赞 · 全场最高记录。；熊狼狗又一力作，脑洞五颗星，基本没有弱点。高度发达的资本主义修仙世界，节奏感和幽…</div><div class='review-src'>起点图</div></div>
<div class='review-item' onclick='showBookModal("灵境行者")' style='cursor:pointer'><div class='review-book'>⭐ 灵境行者</div><div class='review-snippet'>卖报小郎君《大奉打更人》后作，20万均订荣耀五星。前期副本精彩，道观舞鞋令人印象深刻。但中后期渐显龙傲天感，结尾被评弱化主线、多线叙事水文。；无限流，高开低走。卖报的书最大特色就是开车，后期写崩了，烂尾。</div><div class='review-src'>起点图</div></div>
<div class='review-item' onclick='showBookModal("斗破苍穹")' style='cursor:pointer'><div class='review-book'>⭐ 斗破苍穹</div><div class='review-snippet'>「三十年河东，三十年河西，莫欺少年穷！」——国民级经典，退婚流祖师，网文里程碑。爽点节奏堪称典范，情怀分满分。后期换地图引发争议，但整体无损其历史地位。；这本小说应该不需要过多介绍吧，网文小说的里程碑之一。至今还记得「三十年河东，三十年河西…</div><div class='review-src'>起点图</div></div>
<div class='review-item' onclick='showBookModal("大奉打更人")' style='cursor:pointer'><div class='review-book'>⭐ 大奉打更人</div><div class='review-snippet'>「今日无事，勾栏听曲」——2020年现象级神作，15万均订，仙侠+探案+权谋融合极佳。许七安从警校毕业生到搅动朝堂的热血逆袭，梗密集群像强，开创了一个时代的话题效应。；打更人确实好看，卖报的里程碑作品。站点内论雪白文，打更人是怎么都绕不开的…</div><div class='review-src'>起点图</div></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <div id='book-modal' style='display:none;position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:1000;background:rgba(0,0,0,0.75);backdrop-filter:blur(8px);align-items:center;justify-content:center;' onclick='if(event.target===this)closeBookModal()'><div style='background:var(--bg2);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);border-radius:24px;padding:32px;max-width:420px;width:90%;position:relative;'><button onclick='closeBookModal()' style='position:absolute;top:16px;right:16px;background:none;border:none;color:var(--muted);font-size:20px;cursor:pointer;'>✕</button><div id='m-title' style='font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:8px;'></div><div id='m-author' style='font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:4px;'></div><div id='m-genre' style='font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:12px;'></div><div id='m-score' style='font-size:28px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:16px;'></div><div id='m-summary' style='font-size:13px;color:var(--text);line-height:1.7;'></div><a id='m-link' href='#' target='_blank' style='display:inline-block;margin-top:16px;padding:10px 20px;background:rgba(143,184,242,0.15);color:var(--gold);border-radius:12px;text-decoration:none;font-size:13px;'>在起点阅读 →</a></div></div>
  <script>var bookData={"玄鉴仙族":{"bid":"1035420986","score":"59分","summary":"陆江仙残魂附于青灰色铜镜，飘落修仙世界。小家族拾镜，传仙道授仙法，开启波澜壮阔的新时代。"},"夜无疆":{"bid":"1040765595","score":"57分","summary":"辰东东方玄幻新作。那一天太阳落下再也没有升起……"},"捞尸人":{"bid":"1041637443","score":"55分","summary":"长江捞尸人：捞尸价3.6万，曾一月捞上百人。悬疑灵异题材，紧张刺激。"},"青山":{"bid":"1034358924","score":"46分","summary":"巫蛊情降术师林八荒回归故里，卷起南疆风云。"},"没钱修什么仙？":{"bid":"1044718376","score":"45分","summary":"修仙界底层少年的逆袭之路，没钱没背景只能靠肝。"},"苟在武道世界成圣":{"bid":"1037829481","score":"44分","summary":"穿越武道世界，稳健流修仙，苟到极致成就大道。"},"元始法则":{"bid":"1035428765","score":"42分","summary":"蒸汽朋克修仙世界观，法则与因果的博弈。"},"诡秘之主":{"bid":"1010868264","score":"38分","summary":"克苏鲁风异世大陆，小克辗转成为愚者。"},"灵境行者":{"bid":"1025056266","score":"35分","summary":"都市异能灵境副本，热血与悬疑交织。"},"深海余烬":{"bid":"1034360760","score":"32分","summary":"大航海时代背景的奇幻冒险，迷雾与秘宝。"},"夜的命名术":{"bid":"1029887645","score":"30分","summary":"双世界穿越，时停与数据化的极致爽文。"},"道诡异仙":{"bid":"1031287649","score":"28分","summary":"克苏鲁与修仙结合，精神污染的诡异仙侠。"},"故障天赋":{"bid":"1040765234","score":"26分","summary":"赛博朋克设定下的异能者，高科技低生活的世界。"},"请闭上眼睛":{"bid":"1037856432","score":"24分","summary":"都市悬疑惊悚向，闭上眼睛才能看到真相。"},"牧者":{"bid":"1028476593","score":"22分","summary":"田园流异世种田文，安静祥和的异世界生活。"},"大奉打更人":{"bid":"1019664125","score":"0分","summary":"2020年现象级神作，15万均订。仙侠+探案+权谋融合极佳，主角许七安从警校毕业生到搅动朝堂的热血逆袭。"}};function showBookModal(title){var b=bookData[title];if(!b)return;document.getElementById('m-title').textContent=title;document.getElementById('m-author').textContent=b.author||'';document.getElementById('m-genre').textContent=b.category||'';document.getElementById('m-score').textContent=b.score||'';document.getElementById('m-summary').textContent=b.summary||'';document.getElementById('m-link').href='https://www.qidian.com/book/'+(b.bid||'');document.getElementById('book-modal').style.display='flex';document.body.style.overflow='hidden';}function closeBookModal(){document.getElementById('book-modal').style.display='none';document.body.style.overflow='';}document.addEventListener('keydown',function(e){if(e.key==='+"'\"'"+')closeBookModal();});</script>
  <script>(function(){var canvas=document.getElementById('sword'),ctx=canvas.getContext('2d'),dpr=Math.min(devicePixelRatio,2);function rs(){canvas.width=window.innerWidth*dpr;canvas.height=window.innerHeight*dpr;canvas.style.cssText='width:'+window.innerWidth+'px;height:'+window.innerHeight+'px';ctx.setTransform(dpr,0,0,dpr,0,0);}rs();window.addEventListener('resize',rs);var mx=window.innerWidth/2,my=window.innerHeight/2,tx=mx,ty=my,angle=-Math.PI/2,trail=[],sparks=[],t=0;window.addEventListener('mousemove',function(e){tx=e.clientX;ty=e.clientY;});function update(){mx+=(tx-mx)*0.1;my+=(ty-my)*0.1;var dx=tx-mx,dy=ty-my;if(Math.abs(dx)>0.5||Math.abs(dy)>0.5){var ta=Math.atan2(dy,dx);var diff=ta-angle;while(diff>Math.PI)diff-=Math.PI*2;while(diff<-Math.PI)diff+=Math.PI*2;angle+=diff*0.1;}if(Math.random()<0.95){trail.push({x:mx,y:my,vx:-Math.cos(angle)*(1+Math.random()),vy:-Math.sin(angle)*(1+Math.random()),life:1.5,size:1.5+Math.random()*2});}var speed=Math.sqrt((tx-mx)*(tx-mx)+(ty-my)*(ty-my));if(speed>1.5&&Math.random()<0.8){sparks.push({x:mx,y:my,vx:(Math.random()-0.5)*14,vy:(Math.random()-0.5)*14,life:1.2,size:2+Math.random()*3});}for(var i=trail.length-1;i>=0;i--){var p=trail[i];p.x+=p.vx;p.y+=p.vy;p.vx*=0.95;p.vy*=0.95;p.life-=0.018;if(p.life<=0)trail.splice(i,1);}if(trail.length>150)trail=trail.slice(-150);for(var i=sparks.length-1;i>=0;i--){var p=sparks[i];p.x+=p.vx;p.y+=p.vy;p.vx*=0.92;p.vy*=0.92;p.life-=0.025;if(p.life<=0)sparks.splice(i,1);}if(sparks.length>80)sparks=sparks.slice(-80);t++;}function drawSword(x,y,ang){ctx.save();ctx.translate(x,y);ctx.rotate(ang);var grd=ctx.createRadialGradient(0,0,0,0,0,90);grd.addColorStop(0,'rgba(180,210,255,0.1)');grd.addColorStop(1,'rgba(180,210,255,0)');ctx.beginPath();ctx.arc(0,0,90,0,Math.PI*2);ctx.fillStyle=grd;ctx.fill();ctx.shadowColor='rgba(200,220,255,0.6)';ctx.shadowBlur=16;var tipX=75,shoulderW=3.5,guardX=-14;ctx.beginPath();ctx.moveTo(tipX,0);ctx.lineTo(20,-shoulderW);ctx.lineTo(guardX,-3);ctx.lineTo(guardX,3);ctx.lineTo(20,shoulderW);ctx.closePath();var bladeGrd=ctx.createLinearGradient(guardX,0,tipX,0);bladeGrd.addColorStop(0,'rgba(80,100,160,0.5)');bladeGrd.addColorStop(0.25,'rgba(160,200,255,0.85)');bladeGrd.addColorStop(0.6,'rgba(220,240,255,0.95)');bladeGrd.addColorStop(1,'rgba(255,255,255,1)');ctx.fillStyle=bladeGrd;ctx.fill();ctx.shadowBlur=0;ctx.beginPath();ctx.moveTo(-12,0);ctx.lineTo(65,0);ctx.strokeStyle='rgba(255,255,255,0.75)';ctx.lineWidth=1;ctx.stroke();ctx.beginPath();ctx.moveTo(8,-2.2);ctx.quadraticCurveTo(40,-1,62,0);ctx.strokeStyle='rgba(160,200,255,0.3)';ctx.lineWidth=0.7;ctx.stroke();ctx.beginPath();ctx.moveTo(8,2.2);ctx.quadraticCurveTo(40,1,62,0);ctx.strokeStyle='rgba(160,200,255,0.3)';ctx.lineWidth=0.7;ctx.stroke();ctx.beginPath();ctx.arc(-15,0,9,0,Math.PI*2);var gg=ctx.createRadialGradient(-15,0,1,-15,0,9);gg.addColorStop(0,'rgba(255,230,150,1)');gg.addColorStop(0.6,'rgba(210,170,80,0.95)');gg.addColorStop(1,'rgba(160,120,40,0.85)');ctx.fillStyle=gg;ctx.fill();ctx.strokeStyle='rgba(255,220,100,0.6)';ctx.lineWidth=1.5;ctx.stroke();ctx.beginPath();ctx.moveTo(-22,0);ctx.lineTo(-8,0);ctx.strokeStyle='rgba(140,100,30,0.8)';ctx.lineWidth=2;ctx.stroke();ctx.beginPath();ctx.arc(-15,0,3.5,0,Math.PI*2);ctx.strokeStyle='rgba(140,100,30,0.6)';ctx.lineWidth=1;ctx.stroke();ctx.beginPath();ctx.moveTo(-15,-3.2);ctx.bezierCurveTo(-22,-3.2,-22,3.2,-15,3.2);ctx.lineTo(-15,-3.2);ctx.fillStyle='rgba(60,40,15,0.95)';ctx.fill();for(var gi=0;gi<7;gi++){var px=-17-gi*2.5;ctx.beginPath();ctx.moveTo(px,-3.2);ctx.bezierCurveTo(px-0.5,0,px-0.5,0,px,3.2);ctx.strokeStyle='rgba(140,180,240,0.45)';ctx.lineWidth=1.5;ctx.stroke();}ctx.beginPath();ctx.moveTo(-34,-2.5);ctx.bezierCurveTo(-40,-1.5,-40,1.5,-34,2.5);ctx.lineTo(-34,-2.5);ctx.fillStyle='rgba(50,30,10,0.9)';ctx.fill();ctx.beginPath();ctx.arc(-41,0,6,0,Math.PI*2);var pg=ctx.createRadialGradient(-41,0,0,-41,0,6);pg.addColorStop(0,'rgba(200,230,255,0.9)');pg.addColorStop(0.5,'rgba(140,190,255,0.7)');pg.addColorStop(1,'rgba(80,140,220,0.5)');ctx.fillStyle=pg;ctx.shadowColor='rgba(180,210,255,0.8)';ctx.shadowBlur=12;ctx.fill();ctx.strokeStyle='rgba(255,255,255,0.4)';ctx.lineWidth=1;ctx.stroke();ctx.beginPath();ctx.arc(-41,0,2.5,0,Math.PI*2);ctx.fillStyle='rgba(60,40,15,0.8)';ctx.shadowBlur=0;ctx.fill();for(var ti=0;ti<3;ti++){var _tx=-41,_ty=0,phase=ti*0.8+t*0.002;ctx.beginPath();ctx.moveTo(_tx,_ty+(ti-1)*2);ctx.quadraticCurveTo(_tx-8,_ty+(ti-1)*2+Math.sin(phase)*4,_tx-15,_ty+(ti-1)*2+Math.sin(phase)*6+5);ctx.strokeStyle='rgba(160,200,255,0.65)';ctx.lineWidth=1;ctx.stroke();}ctx.restore();}function render(){ctx.clearRect(0,0,canvas.width,canvas.height);for(var i=0;i<trail.length;i++){var p=trail[i];ctx.beginPath();ctx.arc(p.x,p.y,p.size*p.life,0,Math.PI*2);ctx.fillStyle='rgba(180,210,255,'+(p.life*0.5)+')';ctx.shadowColor='rgba(180,210,255,0.5)';ctx.shadowBlur=6;ctx.fill();}ctx.shadowBlur=0;for(var i=0;i<sparks.length;i++){var p=sparks[i];ctx.beginPath();ctx.arc(p.x,p.y,p.size*p.life,0,Math.PI*2);ctx.fillStyle='rgba(180,220,255,'+(p.life*0.8)+')';ctx.shadowColor='rgba(180,220,255,0.6)';ctx.shadowBlur=8;ctx.fill();}ctx.shadowBlur=0;drawSword(mx,my,angle);}function loop(){update();render();requestAnimationFrame(loop);}loop();})();</script>
</body>
</html>